| recentWorkspaces | main store | `RecentWorkspace[]` (max 10) | paths only, never file contents |
| modelState / modelLabel | `settings.get` | `'configured' \| 'missing' \| 'error'`, string \| null | label is provider+model, never a key or credentialed URL |

